--// Full workflow:
--// - Reads live accessoryCraftConfig + materialDropConfig.
--// - Calculates missing materials for selected accessories.
--// - Compares HxH acts with the new Infinite material tables.
--// - Uses live difficulty-aware chances/unlock waves from materialDropConfig.
--// - Can route to ZZZ Infinite for Fine Cloth/Mana Feather/Waves Core and
--//   deep-wave SunCore/Forbidden Fruit boss drops when it is the better route.
--// - Auto farms/retries until at least one selected recipe is craftable.
